{"repositoryId":1423717658,"availability":"available","full":"Majortarif/Air-Quality-Prediction-using-Machine-Learning-and-AI","name":"Air-Quality-Prediction-using-Machine-Learning-and-AI","description":"Real-time air quality monitoring for Dhaka: US EPA AQI, a Random Forest running in the browser, live Open-Meteo data and an IoT sensor mode. CSE400C capstone, East West University.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-17T20:31:11Z","updated":"2026-10-17T20:31:26Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://airqualitypredictionapp.netlify.app/","topics":["air-quality","aqi","bangladesh","capstone-project","chartjs","dhaka","environmental-monitoring","esp32","iot","javascript","lightgbm","machine-learning","netlify","open-meteo","random-forest","scikit-learn"],"demo":"https://airqualitypredictionapp.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.788Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.788Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.788Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.788Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Dhaka is one of the most polluted cities on Earth, and official monitoring stations are few and far between. This project is our CSE400C capstone at East West University. We built a low-cost IoT sensor node, collected 62,188 readings in Badda and Aftabnagar, trained a Random Forest to predict the US EPA Air Quality Index, and shipped it as a real-time web dashboard that anyone can open on a phone.","The whole app is one HTML file. The trained forest is exported to JSON and runs in the browser, with no server, no build step and no API key."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Majortarif/Air-Quality-Prediction-using-Machine-Learning-and-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"484998446921b6c47bbdc019dc05224171430dfef516381a561d5222865cd7d5","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.916Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15: